frameworks such as TensorFlow

00:11:36.430 --> 00:11:40.960
or PyTorch, but they also
have data analytics capability

00:11:40.960 --> 00:11:44.500
so that you can get a big
data image with things

00:11:44.500 --> 00:11:46.510
like Apache Beam
pre-installed so

00:11:46.510 --> 00:11:51.620
that you can quickly and easily
manage your own data cluster.

00:11:51.620 --> 00:11:55.070
Explainability is at the heart
of understanding our machine

00:11:55.070 --> 00:11:57.100
learning.

00:11:57.100 --> 00:12:01.660
We believe heavily and have
invested heavily in this space.

00:12:01.660 --> 00:12:03.620
As you can see at
the top of the slide

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:07.110
are images of
explainability showing

00:12:07.110 --> 00:12:09.450
what pixels in
particular the model

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:11.880
may have used to
render its judgment.

00:12:11.880 --> 00:12:16.620
Down below on the slide is a
picture of feature importance

00:12:16.620 --> 00:12:19.200
from a tabular use case.

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:21.690
Both of these provide
tremendous value

00:12:21.690 --> 00:12:25.620
to data scientists in both
understanding why the model is

00:12:25.620 --> 00:12:27.390
doing what it's
doing, as well as

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:32.130
ensuring that the model is doing
what it's supposed to be doing.

00:12:32.130 --> 00:12:35.240
We don't think of explainability
and explainable AI

00:12:35.240 --> 00:12:39.890
as some separate field that can
only be used by the experts.

00:12:39.890 --> 00:12:42.200
We believe it's
central, and as such,

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:45.320
we include it with every
prediction in our prediction

00:12:45.320 --> 00:12:46.370
service.

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:49.970
We simply publish all of
the explaining results

00:12:49.970 --> 00:12:52.550
in the same blogs we
publish your inferences

00:12:52.550 --> 00:12:54.890
so that you can go
back and look to see

00:12:54.890 --> 00:12:59.150
if you're experiencing
unexpected drift or skew so

00:12:59.150 --> 00:13:03.500
that you'll know when it's
time to retrain the model.

00:13:03.500 --> 00:13:05.900
Not only do we like to meet
customers where they are,

00:13:05.900 --> 00:13:07.580
but we ensure that
we can quickly

00:13:07.580 --> 00:13:12.670
deploy the highest quality AI
for easy business outcomes.

